abstract: >-
  Academic desktop software for tonic-anchored pitch, interval, melodic
  direction, and glissando analysis in Turkish makam music recordings, with
  cent and 53-Hc measurements and DOCX reporting.
keywords:
  - Turkish makam music
  - pitch analysis
  - music information retrieval
  - microtonal music
  - fundamental frequency
  - YIN
